      "created_at": "2012-01-26T20:05:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tried to see if this was answered already, but it doesnt appear so; When fighting Omnitron he will have multiple devices out that say ‘Remove from play when Omnitron takes ‘x’ damage’.</p>\n<p>So, if two devices are in play that each take 7 damage to Omnitron to remove from play, would they both go away after dealing 7 damage, or would you have to do 14 damage to remove both of them?</p>",
