      "created_at": "2012-03-06T01:38:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A related question that we encountered recently, when the heroes have accumulated 7 or more damage to Omnitron, does the components such as Electro-Magnetic Railgun get destroyed immediately? Or only at the end of the round (i.e. after the End of Environment phase)?</p>\n<p>This affects whether Interpolation Beam continues to make heroes take damage for drawing cards or not.</p>",
